
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  HOSTS FILE CONFIGURATION REQUIRED
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  The platform is published on host ports of 127.0.0.1.
  Point the platform hostnames at it by adding this line to /etc/hosts:

    127.0.0.1 nebari.local keycloak.nebari.local argocd.nebari.local

  Then open https://nebari.local in your browser.

  /etc/hosts has no wildcard support: services exposed later on other
  subdomains need their hostname appended to the same line.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

